{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser","id":40539,"title":"Mortal Remains Fiction Teaser","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T09:43:52-08:00","id":40539,"title":"Mortal Remains Fiction Teaser","content":"Over on her blog, Monica Valentinelli teases some of her fiction from the upcoming book Mortal Remains.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.mlvwrites.com/2013/12/hunter-mortal-remains-preview.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter: Mortal Remains Preview</a><br /> <br /> Enjoy!<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T09:55:59-08:00","id":40544,"title":"","content":"Never mess with those tricky fae.. :P<br /> <br /> Nice- very nice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T10:10:47-08:00","id":40560,"title":"","content":"Ah Carlos, clearly no one taught you paid questions 101: spend 30 seconds minimum thinking of each question. Always ask one highly comprehensive question when you can &quot;My friend Mags has gone missing, what can you tell me that will help me find her&quot;?<br /> <br /> Great story <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T10:20:00-08:00","id":40566,"title":"","content":"Actually, with some thought, you don't need to ask any question at all. For example, instead of asking &quot;do you know anything about Mags?&quot; you can say &quot;My friend Mag has gone missing. I wish you to tell me if you know where she is&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit- of course, it is easy for us to judge Carlos. It's not us who have one friend killed and the other missing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T10:24:13-08:00","id":40568,"title":"","content":"But why would Zanthus answer that? He's only agreed to answer questions and only for a price.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T10:56:58-08:00","id":40583,"title":"","content":"He agreed to answer questions only because Carlos has agreed to pay a price for questions. It wasn't an initial part of the agreement for the interview itself, so perhaps if he didn't agreed to that part than Zanthus may have cooperated, for his own reasons.<br /> <br /> I'm just saying- it is a dark fairy tale. There should be a way out of those kind of things- unless you decide there shouldn't. And in anyway, you should always at least try to find a way out, right? :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T11:24:58-08:00","id":40603,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the support! I'm glad you're digging into the design of this piece. This interview is part of a larger story; we opted to go with a single investigation that's tied together throughout the book. Carlos is definitely in over his head -- and it gets worse from there. Can't want to see what you think of the whole interstitial experience!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T11:34:06-08:00","id":40607,"title":"","content":"And this, kids, is why you watch your <i>every word</i> when making deals with the Fae. When they say they'll have a favour from you for each question you ask, they mean it. Of course, it's probably too late for our unfortunate hunter to make use of this lesson.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":186,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","user":"Morty","date":". 01-01-2014, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","name":"Morty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T11:55:37-08:00","id":40619,"title":"","content":"You're welcome. BTW, mlvalentine (or anyone else) I have a question. Compared to the current suppliments how much text is each individual group getting?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 01-01-2014, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T12:06:48-08:00","id":40623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40619#post40619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're welcome. BTW, mlvalentine (or anyone else) I have a question. Compared to the current suppliments how much text is each individual group getting?</div> </div> </div> </div>If by &quot;group&quot; you mean &quot;monster type&quot;, each one gets its own chapter. The developer can speak to the specifics on word count and other content in this tome. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T12:34:52-08:00","id":40635,"title":"","content":"I meant in the fae chapter how much text is the Union, Lucifuge, etc reeving.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T12:52:16-08:00","id":40655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40635#post40635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I meant in the fae chapter how much text is the Union, Lucifuge, etc reeving.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, that I'm not sure. The devs could probably answer that for you. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T13:22:13-08:00","id":40689,"title":"","content":"Something which I wonder about this fiction..<br /> <br /> At first, Zanthus simply asked for one favor, right? Than, in return for letting Carlos asking questions, he forced him to give him a favor per question. Than, after gathering so many favors, he kindly offered to &quot;merge all of the 7 favors&quot; into one thing...<br /> <br /> Now, isn't it means that, in a way, Carlos simply gives him a single favor? And that means that, in a way, he could have just demanded it without forcing Carlos for giving him more favors? That's why, I think that Zanthus would have cooperated if Carlos had found a loophole at the &quot;no asking&quot; thing. After all, Zanthus never wanted something more than a single favor!<br /> <br /> In short, Zanthus is a real bastard- and I like him (actually, I've one had a similar exercise in my acting class- just that you had to ask questions at every sentence)<br /> <br /> P.S- I'm really glad that this fiction is a part of a longer story. I really nice idea! (..and poor Carlos..)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T14:45:32-08:00","id":40744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40689#post40689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Now, isn't it means that, in a way, Carlos simply gives him a single favor? And that means that, in a way, he could have just demanded it without forcing Carlos for giving him more favors? That's why, I think that Zanthus would have cooperated if Carlos had found a loophole at the &quot;no asking&quot; thing. After all, Zanthus never wanted something more than a single favor!</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this the part where I say **spoiler alert**? Okay, maybe author's intent is a better turn-of-phrase here. Either way...<br /> <br /> Say you're a Changeling who's charged with guarding a fairy ring in Central Park. An odd mortal crosses your path for the first time. You don't know what he knows or how well he knows it. So, you mess with him to figure out how green he really is. Things go badly for Carlos because he's obviously in over his head -- which is the point of the story -- and Zanthus ends up feeling sorry for him. In context, the last three lines are very, very important to the overall story arc. Zanthus figures if Carlos can actually survive his ordeal, then he'd make a good guardian. That's the reason for the smoke-and-daggers. A favor might work for a story specific to Changelings, but this isn't a story about them. It's a &quot;whodunnit&quot; tale where Carlos is trying to track down a supernatural murderer. By the end of the interview, Zanthus reveals he doesn't have faith in Carlos. If he can't manage a simple fae trick -- which is what this interview proves -- then in his mind Carlos certainly won't be able to deal with what follows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T15:27:37-08:00","id":40759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40744#post40744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is this the part where I say **spoiler alert**? Okay, maybe author's intent is a better turn-of-phrase here. Either way...<br /> <br /> Say you're a Changeling who's charged with guarding a fairy ring in Central Park. An odd mortal crosses your path for the first time. You don't know what he knows or how well he knows it. So, you mess with him to figure out how green he really is. Things go badly for Carlos because he's obviously in over his head -- which is the point of the story -- and Zanthus ends up feeling sorry for him. In context, the last three lines are very, very important to the overall story arc. Zanthus figures if Carlos can actually survive his ordeal, then he'd make a good guardian. That's the reason for the smoke-and-daggers. A favor might work for a story specific to Changelings, but this isn't a story about them. It's a &quot;whodunnit&quot; tale where Carlos is trying to track down a supernatural murderer. By the end of the interview, Zanthus reveals he doesn't have faith in Carlos. If he can't manage a simple fae trick -- which is what this interview proves -- then in his mind Carlos certainly won't be able to deal with what follows.</div> </div> </div> </div>Annnnd that's the Lost for you.<br /> <br /> &quot;We play tricks on you so you <i>might</i> be prepared for the True Fae.&quot;<br /> <br /> Very Autumn Court-ish there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T15:42:01-08:00","id":40766,"title":"","content":"I must say, I'm very impressed that the writers are going with a continuing storyline format. The fiction for <i>Night Horrors</i> pulled this off excellently, and what has been discussed so far is also giving me a very <i>Horror Recognition Guide</i>-esque feel. I can honestly say that I am getting more and more excited for this book, and not just because one of my splats has new material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T16:59:59-08:00","id":40821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40766#post40766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must say, I'm very impressed that the writers are going with a continuing storyline format. The fiction for <i>Night Horrors</i> pulled this off excellently, and what has been discussed so far is also giving me a very <i>Horror Recognition Guide</i>-esque feel. I can honestly say that I am getting more and more excited for this book, and not just because one of my splats has new material.</div> </div> </div> </div>D'awwww... You nailed it. The <i>Horror Recognition Guide</i> was an inspiration recommended to me by Matt McElroy. There's just one writer for the fiction this time around -- me. Hope you'll be thrilled with this! Always love the feedback. And, more importantly... Hope you enjoy what the other writers have come up with! :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1870,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","user":"mlvalentine","date":".  Clarification: so I didn't sound like a total diva. 01-01-2014, 08:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T17:07:55-08:00","id":40827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40821#post40821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> D'awwww... You nailed it. The <i>Horror Recognition Guide</i> was an inspiration recommended to me by Matt McElroy. There's just one writer for the fiction this time around -- me. Hope you'll be thrilled with this! Always love the feedback. And, more importantly... Hope you enjoy what the other writers have come up with! :-)</div> </div> </div> </div>To put it in perspective: I have made characters in the fiction, who are not even written-up NPCs in the first place, part of my own integral canon and fiction \u2014 to the part I will include them in games I run/help run/participate in \u2014 because I like them so much.<br /> <br /> I also do hope you stick around the forum. Something that makes me very sad is that a lot of the Hunter writers don't seem to be around anymore, and I would have loved to ask them their opinions/certain questions/their thoughts on what they published in the material. One of my favourite things when I started getting into Hunter was when I went and looked at old forum replies, and found ideas and unincluded backstory and the like. It just made the world feel more whole and rich to me, all these little tidbits that the author included we could use in our games (and fanfics, in my case).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T17:40:04-08:00","id":40842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40827#post40827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To put it in perspective: I have made characters in the fiction, who are not even written-up NPCs in the first place, part of my own integral canon and fiction \u2014 to the part I will include them in games I run/help run/participate in \u2014 because I like them so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, cool! Then you should know I put some Easter Eggs in the fiction. You'll want to pay special attention to the fate and names of all characters. That should help you create rules for them if you so desire.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40827#post40827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also do hope you stick around the forum.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I will do what I can. I'm working on HUNTER: DARK ERAS as well and I've been loving the WW/OP community. For the most part, everybody has been really cool and supportive of my work. I don't want to lose sight of that, no matter where I end up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T17:59:15-08:00","id":40849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/40539-mortal-remains-fiction-teaser?p=40842#post40842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! I will do what I can. I'm working on HUNTER: DARK ERAS as well and I've been loving the WW/OP community. For the most part, everybody has been really cool and supportive of my work. I don't want to lose sight of that, no matter where I end up.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><i>YOU.</i></b><br /> <br /> You are awesome, thank you very much for all that you're doing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I can't wait to see what you come up with, and, if your muse happens to lead you that way, I would also love to see what you can do with characters mentioned in previous books, but not explored in the other books in <i>Hunter</i>. (Diana Broken-Arrow from <i>Spirit Slayers</i>, Harriet Geist from <i>Witch Finders</i>, those witches in the corebook enslaved to a suicide-inducing radio station....)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T06:26:26-08:00","id":42254,"title":"","content":"Loved the preview. This is easily my most anticipated book of the year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachment